{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13302","headline":"送王相公之幽州 · 皇甫冉","name":"送王相公之幽州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自昔萧曹任，难兼卫霍功。\n勤劳无远近，旌节屡西东。\n不选三河卒，还令万里通。\n雁行缘古塞，马鬣起长风。\n遮虏关山静，防秋鼓角雄。\n徒思一攀送，羸老荜门中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}